      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bH6",
      "roundness": {
        "type": 3
      },
      "seed": 1005167135,
      "version": 135,
      "versionNonce": 1658920945,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1773631764676,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false
    },
    {
      "id": "hv01MuENzDMHEi6nJWjkn",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 580.9601440429688,
      "y": 2970.1000366210938,
      "width": 377.27984619140625,
      "height": 125,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bH7",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1637265343,
      "version": 674,
      "versionNonce": 937002143,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1773631906871,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "共享内存和文件内存映射（mmap）都利用\n了虚拟文件系统（VFS）的统一接口，将\n底层资源抽象为文件，通过 struct file 和\n地址空间（address_space）\n管理物理内存页，实现高效访问。",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "共享内存和文件内存映射（mmap）都利用了虚拟文件系统（VFS）的统一接口，将底层资源抽象为文件，通过 struct file 和地址空间（address_space）\n管理物理内存页，实现高效访问。",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "PE9J9-VqnBRGdTozP5WAN",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 26.4000244140625,
      "y": 3212.699951171875,
      "width": 80,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bH8",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 227069983,
      "version": 193,
      "versionNonce": 1212361823,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1773631930272,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "使用场景",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "使用场景",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "qUds03PhKQIKKrnfVL2VR",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 27.030029296875,
      "y": 3253.7999877929688,
      "width": 781.1399536132812,
      "height": 50,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bH9",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 678786239,
      "version": 67,
      "versionNonce": 1897837279,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1773631941602,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. 实现进程间通信posix版本(另外一种共享内存映射的实现通信的方法原理，感兴趣的可\n以再去了解一下)",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. 实现进程间通信posix版本(另外一种共享内存映射的实现通信的方法原理，感兴趣的可以再去了解一下)",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "BIoVF56f23zcG-ZpBFTev",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 21.070037841796875,
      "y": 3319.4000244140625,
      "width": 796.2599487304688,
      "height": 50,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bHA",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1532525233,
      "version": 51,
      "versionNonce": 77915505,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1773631949692,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "2. 被加载的文件是不是也可以是动态库呢？动态库就是通过mmap，打开到内存之后，映射\n到进程地址空间的，得到动态库其实虚拟地址，然后进行动态库动态重定位。",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "2. 被加载的文件是不是也可以是动态库呢？动态库就是通过mmap，打开到内存之后，映射到进程地址空间的，得到动态库其实虚拟地址，然后进行动态库动态重定位。",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "tX8JnxN3ZVrcmacmWsfGu",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 18.380020141601562,
      "y": 3393.5,
      "width": 305.6399841308594,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bHB",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 8815839,
      "version": 110,
      "versionNonce": 1654356287,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1773631948062,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "3. 也可以用来实现：数据库技术！",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "3. 也可以用来实现：数据库技术！",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    }
  ],
